    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb5bf82f14854b5b500ad12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她真的太自由了，我实在跟不上……！\n看她踩着轻快脚步离去的背影，\n我只能用无力的脚追上去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b8741aeb338f90aee6e88a69b8d849f03a43c5484fd46110cc47e1f344958c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
