      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "的确，为了活用在之后的训练，\n绝对不能错过接下来的表演赛……\n正当我这么想的时候──",
      "source_fingerprint": "12272ab3c85d2bf60b73415c71e8bb896aefa7dd027d23b361e39a57c8876a31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
